# Brio actions

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for full context.

## Chrome → Brio

- Use `data-click`, `data-change`, `data-input` — never `onclick=` or per-button `addEventListener` for UI chrome.
- Actions are global functions on `window` with signature `(el, event, target)`.

```html
<!-- good -->
<button data-click=play>
<button data-click="openDialog(settings)">
<select data-change=filterDuration>

<!-- bad -->
<button onclick="play()">
```

## Dialogs

- Native `<dialog id=… class="dialog-sheet">` with Brio contract.
- Close: `data-el=close-button` + `data-click="closeDialog(id)"`.
- No custom scrim divs.

## Not via Brio

Audio events, sentence clicks, `pagehide`, settings range keyboard, `setLangPref` cookie sync — keep in project JS.

## Updating Brio

Copy from `../brio/` into `assets/brio/` — no build step. Preserve load order: `brio.css` → `styles.css` → `brio.js` → project JS.
